    "id": "E12",
    "title": "A filesystem mount can finish before userspace starts",
    "environment": "PinePhone QEMU",
    "method": "Debugger-observed return value, mount list and subsequent waiting thread",
    "observation": "The original HFS mount returned success, while the root vnode was not yet installed and startup waited in a platform service handshake.",
    "limits": "Mount success is one stage. It does not establish launchd, writable data, graphical startup or full boot-chain authenticity.",
